# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
build/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Generated files
*.freezed.dart
*.g.dart
*.reflectable.dart

# Alchemist golden hygiene: only renderer-stable CI goldens
# (test/**/goldens/ci/) are committed. Platform goldens are human-review
# artifacts that differ per host renderer; failure diffs are transient.
# Leading **/ so these match nested package test dirs
# (packages/**/test/...), not just a root-level test/.
**/test/**/failures/
**/test/**/goldens/macos/
**/test/**/goldens/linux/
**/test/**/goldens/windows/

# Drift/wasm runtime assets (#288 D2): sqlite3.wasm + drift_worker.js are
# versioned artifacts of the `drift` release, fetched by
# `melos run web:assets` (tool/fetch_web_assets.dart), never committed — a
# checked-in copy drifts against pubspec.lock in silence.
**/sqlite3.wasm
**/drift_worker.js
**/.drift-web-assets
# Staging file for an in-flight fetch. The tool clears it on every failure
# path and before each run, but a signal kills it mid-transfer without
# running anything, and `flutter build web` copies all of `web/`.
**/*.part
